1 NOTE He reigned 1216 to 1272. He was a minor when he took the throne and didn't really start ruling until 1234. He and the Barons had much discontent between each other. He attempted to raise large sums of
2 CONC  money from them and later agreed to reforms with them, but then renounced them. Simon de Montford led a rebellion against him (the Baron Wars; see notes for his son, Edward I) which was defeated afte
2 CONC r initial success.
